[{"episodeSummary":"归无妄痛快地打发方亦楷睡沙发并催他赶紧睡觉。方亦楷顺从地陷进沙发，顺手揉了猫头，玩笑调侃猫嫌弃看他像是平时在这收保护费，要了条薄被防止冻死自己这个「沙发客」。盖好被子后，方亦楷蜷着长腿闭上眼，嘱咐归无妄回屋记得锁好房门别半夜出来被绊倒，最后对她道了句「晚安 归娇娇」。","userId":"uid_1790255859673_etnh6cp03","characterId":"0c02fada-2752-4b73-9ed6-d11585398260","_schemaVersion":4,"_summaryHistorySplit":true,"_rev":1790940392837,"stance":{"text":"虽说窝在窄沙发里蜷着腿，但盖着她拿的薄被、听着她催促，心里只剩落地的踏实。哪怕只当个沙发客，能这样守着她道声晚安就很满足。","updatedAt":"2026-10-02T11:26:23.817Z","basedOnEventId":1790940383369,"basedOnSummaryCount":61,"version":20},"stanceHistory":{"__rowSplit":"array","order":["cy8f4z2d55","1xy6eeb7lpn","1h39nsb3wpr","2dja953c1v3","13xskg3buql","1e9b7qplnyb","1ygbi0hj6y3","jbfjyary9f","of0m17oawb","2ezb4yo6v07","21ps6acjyu8","1juyxnbu46a","9k17i4nm80","d8l9hnt4x3","9nzd764jzb","1dzrz6l5aal","21l23t61isw","pb6r7az4ux","23dvf8hpz8d"]},"enableRelationalGrowth":true,"enableSelfGrowth":true,"growthTrail":{"__rowSplit":"array","order":["1u66l11hq9t","2b9bdaupa6u","1i0ozbeg0b4","se5pjc3lpt","17v19crsdlf","1u85m63qol9","268xa5cymse","6qd8pohhvf","gnuglhydxe","bfhnxvvv0q","l3f24rr2ir","15msnaui037","y3wpo9bid4","bjlg18krjj","26r2bf3xfrw","14kr6cfy9ep","1zke3qv9smy","17codehuucc","2fx7zjlni3r","2cgpxsfink0","195884cebhz","148heu6povj","1k9kgn92482","sh7h41l28n","1qc1z08ii8n","239sfgw9ioa","1m454lz7z4y","28p258kj51v","1pkc9rcr9f9","sbnts7p7dn","1i7bp2ouool","8yb91trfl7","12puxuquezm","1ahucnqk5jn","j1apne2yi0","1r3nj39k47e","1nso8nylf4h"]},"selfStance":{"text":"我依然是那个看谁都不爽、嘴硬欠揍的混球，可现在竟然能老老实实蜷在归娇娇家窄得要命的沙发上当个听话的‘沙发客’；虽然嘴上还是爱犯贱，但只要她一句晚安，我就能安分得像只被收留的家犬。","version":10,"updatedAt":"2026-10-02T11:26:32.630Z","basedOnEventId":null,"basedOnSummaryCount":61},"selfStanceHistory":{"__rowSplit":"array","order":["28ebygcfr8o","1wu5085z6un","22lal963r1n","28uafipyk54","2chgn77yhse","jd469gu3uf","189jdfqn5hd","1v1i2lzqc29"]},"userFacts":[{"content":"user有自己的家，不需要回学校","confidence":0.65,"evidencedBy":[1790873980896],"cat":"user","kind":"timeless"},{"content":"方亦楷和归无妄确认彼此心中只有对方","confidence":0.65,"evidencedBy":[1790874390977]